# The repo root ignores `*.onnx` so nobody commits a trained model by accident.
# These graphs are the deliberate exception: they are a couple of kilobytes each
# and they are the *refusal* half of the model-family gate — the shapes
# skl2onnx and onnxmltools emit by default, committed so that "tract will not
# serve a TreeEnsembleRegressor" is a test rather than something someone
# remembers. Regenerating them next to the assertion would prove nothing.
!*.onnx
